        "id": "2102170392924492207",
        "images": [
          "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HSxoh97bsAAL1zb.jpg?name=small"
        ],
        "name": "Artificial Analysis",
        "text": "Grok 4.7 is behind only Anthropic models on AA-Briefcase, ranking just behind Opus 5 at ~50% of its Cost per Task\n\nGrok 4.7’s improvements over Grok 4.6 are clear in AA-Briefcase-Lite, our public due diligence scenario where models are tasked with building market models and target assessment decks. Grok 4.7 gains significantly in Analytical Quality Elo (1698 → 1994) with a slight regression in Presentation Elo (1531 → 1499).\n\nAPI cost to produce example decks: Grok 4.7 (xhigh) ~$8 vs. Grok 4.6 (xhigh) ~$4.40",
        "url": "https://x.com/ArtificialAnlys/status/2102170392924492207",
        "verified": true,
        "verified_type": "organization"
      },
      "retweet": null,
