      "text": "and here’s the grok 4.7 model card. a few jumps vs 4.6 that stood out:\n\n- Terminal-Bench: 20.3% → 38.0%\n- SWE-Marathon: 31.9% → 46.0%\n- HealthBench Pro: 48.5% → 56.7%\n- Legal Agent: 15.8% → 19.6%\n- EEBench: 60.0% → 66.0%\n\nfor the same price as 4.6!\n\nhttps://media.x.ai/v1/website/4p7card-5eccc980.pdf",
